# The cloned upstream tree is a disposable build artifact, never a tracked file.
# What is versioned here is the *intent* — the apply/unapply patch scripts under
# patches/ — not the *result*. The result is a deterministic function of
# (upstream HEAD + patches), regenerated on demand by scripts/redownload-source.
#
# A surviving modification to Xonotic source inside this repository's history
# would be, by construction, a bug: either a failed unapply or a hand edit that
# should have been written as a patch. This line is what makes that impossible.
source/

# RAM-backed working tiers, both symlinks out of the project:
#   tmp/                -> /tmp/xonotic-turning-radius        (executable scratch)
#   tmp/shared-memory/  -> /dev/shm/xonotic-turning-radius    (logs, build output)
tmp

# Built QuakeC bytecode and packaged data. Products, not sources.
build/
*.dat
*.lno
*.pk3
